  m_text: '<b>Beer Pong</b>: a port of the beer pong table in Thryrallo''s UdonPrefabs
    (github.com/Thryrallo/UdonPrefabs), MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2022 Thryrallo.
    Table and cup models and textures: TsunaMoo (tsunamoo.booth.pm), in the same
    repository.

    Changed for Altspace: URP materials, TextMesh Pro text, a physics
    ball owned by the thrower, a charge bar by the ball.

    Sounds: Kenney Impact
    Sounds and Interface Sounds (kenney.nl, CC0); water splash by ezwa (OpenGameArt,
    CC0).

    Font: Dosis by Edgar Tolentino, Pablo Impallari and Igino Marini,
    SIL Open Font License 1.1.'
